{"pageid":3473,"title":"Version 1.28.0","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Version 1.28.0</span>","revid":15591,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.28.0\">Version 1.28.0</span></h2>\n<p><b>July 21st, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Added:\">Added:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Added Secret Friday content</li>\n<li>Trolleys are back in the store and work properly!</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changed:\">Changed:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Crates now have a 1 second debounce to open / close to prevent server lag</li>\n<li>Increased Large Crate drag power</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed vehicle UI staying visible after deletion of vehicle</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.28.1\">Version 1.28.1</span></h2>\n<p><b>July 21st, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changed:_2\">Changed:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Increased Trolley sell price</li>\n<li>Increment interaction now appears above Decrease interaction</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:_2\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed inspect menu breaking for certain <a href=\"/wiki/Schematics\" title=\"Schematics\">schematics</a></li>\n<li>Fixed hover menu not displaying the correct cost of structures</li>\n<li>Fixed not being able to change the image on <a href=\"/wiki/Flag_Pole\" title=\"Flag Pole\">Flags</a></li>\n<li>Fixed property markers on the world map</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163734\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 20/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip rec